{"id":"0df613e30f0e3f59","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-presburger-decidable.md","title":"Presburger Arithmetic Decidability","display":"thm-presburger-decidable — Presburger Arithmetic Decidability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-presburger-decidable","aliases":["57-thm-presburger-decidable"],"display":"thm-presburger-decidable — Presburger Arithmetic Decidability","depends_on":["[[57-df-decidable-theory]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-first-order-language]]","[[57-df-quantifier-free]]","[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-hilbert-derivable]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-presburger-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-presburger-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-presburger-decidable — Presburger Arithmetic Decidability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4107e891ce817208\" href=\"?note=4107e891ce817208\" title=\"57-df-decidable-theory\">57-df-decidable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"52897755c29c065c\" href=\"?note=52897755c29c065c\" title=\"57-df-hilbert-derivable\">57-df-hilbert-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的非逻辑符号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,+,&lt;\">\\(0,1,+,&lt;\\)</span>，依次为两个常量、二元函数和二元关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_+\">\\(\\mathfrak N_+\\)</span> 为载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 上解释为通常 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,+,&lt;\">\\(0,1,+,&lt;\\)</span> 的结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^\\equiv\">\\(S^\\equiv\\)</span> 再加入互异二元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_d\">\\(\\equiv_d\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\ge2\">\\(d\\ge2\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_+^\\equiv\">\\(\\mathfrak N_+^\\equiv\\)</span> 的新关系由下式定义。各语言使用完成字母表视图，其未列出的非逻辑分区为空。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为该可数有效语言的有效编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> 使用标准 Hilbert 演算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{QFree}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathbb N,+,0,1,&lt;)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathbb N,+,0,1,&lt;)\\)</span> 及其带同余符号写法分别是这两个标准结构理论的兼容记号。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S^\\equiv}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S^\\equiv}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QE}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{QE}(T)\\)</span> 是本原子下式定义的量词消去谓词，原公式与无量词公式均使用已固定的扩张语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^\\equiv\">\\(S^\\equiv\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_d^{\\mathfrak N_+^\\equiv}\\coloneqq\\{(a,b)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists z\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(a-b=dz)\\}\\quad(d\\ge2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_d^{\\mathfrak N_+^\\equiv}\\coloneqq\\{(a,b)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\\exists z\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(a-b=dz)\\}\\quad(d\\ge2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_+\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N_+),\\qquad T_+^\\equiv\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N_+^\\equiv).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_+\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N_+),\\qquad T_+^\\equiv\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathfrak N_+^\\equiv).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathbb N,+,0,1,&lt;)\\coloneqq T_+,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathbb N,+,0,1,&lt;,\\{\\equiv_d\\}_{d\\ge2})\\coloneqq T_+^\\equiv.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathbb N,+,0,1,&lt;)\\coloneqq T_+,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathbb N,+,0,1,&lt;,\\{\\equiv_d\\}_{d\\ge2})\\coloneqq T_+^\\equiv.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QE}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S^\\equiv}\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QF}_{S^\\equiv}\\;\n(\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\land T\\models(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QE}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S^\\equiv}\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QF}_{S^\\equiv}\\;\n(\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\land T\\models(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QE}(T_+^\\equiv)\\land T_+\\in\\mathrm{Dec}\\land T_+^\\equiv\\in\\mathrm{Dec}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QE}(T_+^\\equiv)\\land T_+\\in\\mathrm{Dec}\\land T_+^\\equiv\\in\\mathrm{Dec}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\\exists n\\ge2\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S\\cup\\{\\equiv_d:2\\le d\\le n\\}}\\;\n(\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)\\land\\mathfrak N_+^\\equiv\\models(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\\exists n\\ge2\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S\\cup\\{\\equiv_d:2\\le d\\le n\\}}\\;\n(\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)\\land\\mathfrak N_+^\\equiv\\models(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>显式区别原语言与加入同余关系的消去语言。可判定性不是从一个未给算法的抽象 QE 谓词直接推出；这里分别陈述该具体理论的量词消去和可判定结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-decidable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"4107e891ce817208","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-decidable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df